  "risks": [
    "Micronaut SQL submodules are normally released in lockstep from one multi-module repo, so micronaut-jdbc-hikari:7.1.0 should exist alongside micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0, but this wasn't independently verified against Maven Central in this pass — local Gradle resolution is authoritative.",
    "If tests only call static/standalone utility classes without a live ApplicationContext, coverage of the DI-driven classes in io.micronaut.jdbc.* will be shallow even with the pool dependency present."
